                            </div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    14(a). Annual Turn Over of the Cooperative Society  <span class="text-danger">
                                        <strong>(in Rs.)</strong>
                                    </span>
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <input type="text" ng-model="Tourism.annual_turn_over" placeholder="Annual Turn Over of the Cooperative Society (in Rs)" class="form-control" numbers-only />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    14(b). Do the members themselves have pooled resources (vehicles, accommodation, land etc.) for the cooperative society?
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group d-flex">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tourism.pool_resource" value="1" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="pool_resource">Yes</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tourism.pool_resource" value="0" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="pool_resource">No</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    14(c). Apart from the pooled/common resources of individuals, has the society taken any resources from the government or non-members?
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group d-flex">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tourism.any_resource_taken" value="1" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="any_resource_taken">Yes</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tourism.any_resource_taken" value="0" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="any_resource_taken">No</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label for="common_work_place">
                                    14(d). Is the right vested with the members to take back the shared resources from the society?
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group d-flex">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tourism.is_right_vested" value="1" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="is_right_vested">Yes</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tourism.is_right_vested" value="0" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="is_right_vested">No</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label for="facilities">
                                    14(e). Facilities provided by Cooperative Society
                                </label>
                                <select class="form-control" ng-model="Tourism.facilities" name="facilities" select2 multiple>
                                    <option ng-repeat="item in facilitiesList" value="{{item.id}}">
                                        {{item.name}}
                                    </option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </fieldset>

                    <fieldset class="ncd-box" ng-show="ncd.sector_of_operation == 102">
                        <legend>Primary Tribal SC/ST Cooperative Society Details</legend>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    11(a). Type of SC/ST Cooperative
                                </label>
                                <select ng-model="Tribal.type_society" class="form-control" required>
                                    <option value="">{{translation.SelectOption}}</option>
                                    <option ng-repeat="item in secondaryActivityList" value="{{item.sub_sector_id}}">
                                        {{item.name}}
                                    </option>
                                </select>
                            </div>

                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    11(b). Whether the co-operative society has an office building
                                    <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group d-flex">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tribal.has_building" value="1" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="has_building">Yes</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tribal.has_building" value="0" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="has_building">No</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="col-sm-4" ng-show="Tribal.has_building=='1'">
                                <label for="building_type">
                                    11(c). Type of Office Building
                                </label>
                                <select name="building_type" ng-model="Tribal.building_type" class="form-control" required>
                                    <option value="" disabled="disabled">{{translation.SelectOption}}</option>
                                    <option ng-repeat="item in NCDOfficeBuildingTypes " value="{{item.id}}">
                                        {{item.name}}
                                    </option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    12(a). Authorised Share Capital
                                    <span class="text-danger"><strong>(in Rs.)</strong></span>
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <input type="text" ng-model="Tribal.authorised_share" placeholder="Authorised Share Capital (in Rs)" class="form-control" numbers-only />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-6">
                                <label> 12(b). Paid up Share Capital by different Entity</label>
                                <div class="box-primary box-st">
                                    <table class="table table-bordered">
                                        <thead>
                                            <tr>
                                                <th style="background:#00005f !important; color:#fff;">S. No.</th>
                                                <th style="background:#00005f !important; color:#fff;">Name of Entity</th>
                                                <th style="background:#00005f !important; color:#fff;">Amount <span class="text-danger"><strong>(in Rs.)</strong></span></th>
                                            </tr>
                                        </thead>
                                        <tbody>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>1.</td>
                                                <td>Members</td>
                                                <td>
                                                    <input type="text" placeholder="Enter Amount" ng-model="Tribal.paid_up_members" class="form-control" numbers-only ng-change="TribalCoopSharePaidCalculate()" />
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>2.</td>
                                                <td>Government or Government Bodies</td>
                                                <td>
                                                    <input type="text" placeholder="Enter Amount" class="form-control" ng-model="Tribal.paid_up_government_bodies" numbers-only ng-change="TribalCoopSharePaidCalculate()" />
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td colspan="2" class="text-left"><strong>Total</strong></td>
                                                <td>
                                                    <input type="text" placeholder="Total" readonly class="form-control" ng-model="Tribal.paid_up_total" numbers-only />
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label for="paid_up_share_date">
                                    12(c). Paid up Share Capital Date
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <input type="date" ng-model="Tribal.paid_up_share_date" class="form-control" required disable-before-date />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label for="total_deposit">
                                    12(d). Total Deposit <span class="text-danger"><strong>(in Rs.)</strong></span>
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <input type="text" ng-model="Tribal.total_deposit" placeholder="Total Deposit (in Rs.)" class="form-control" required numbers-only />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label for="pack_total_outstanding_loan">
                                    12(e). Total Amount of Loan Outstanding <span class="text-danger"><strong>(in Rs.)</strong></span>
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <input type="text" ng-model="Tribal.pack_total_outstanding_loan" placeholder="Total Amount of Loan Outstanding (in Rs.)" class="form-control" required numbers-only />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    13(a). Annual Turn Over of the Cooperative Society <span class="text-danger"><strong>(in Rs.)</strong></span>
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <input type="text" ng-model="Tribal.annual_turn_over" placeholder="Annual Turn Over of the Cooperative Society (in Rs)" class="form-control" numbers-only />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    13(d). Whether the work is allotted by State/District Federation to the Society?
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group d-flex">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tribal.state_district_federation" value="1" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="state_district_federation">Yes</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tribal.state_district_federation" value="0" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="state_district_federation">No</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label>
                                    13(e). Whether the cooperative society provide raw material to members & finished products taken after processing?
                                </label>
                                <div class="form-group d-flex">
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tribal.society_provide_raw_material" value="1" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="society_provide_raw_material">Yes</label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="form-check">
                                        <input type="radio" ng-model="Tribal.society_provide_raw_material" value="0" class="form-check-input" required />
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="society_provide_raw_material">No</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-4">
                                <label for="facilities" style="display:block;">
                                    13(f). Facilities provided by Cooperative Society
                                </label>
                                <select class="form-control" ng-model="Tribal.facilities" name="facilities" select2 multiple>
                                    <option ng-repeat="item in facilitiesList" value="{{item.id}}">
                                        {{item.name}}
                                    </option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </fieldset>
                    <div class="row mt-4" ng-show="ncd.sector_of_operation >0">
                        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary" id="saveBtn" ng-click="SaveData()">
                                {{ saving ? 'Saving...' : (isShowforEdit==0?'Update Cooperative Data':'Save Cooperative Data') }}
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Select2 -->
<link href="~/Content/Stylesheets/select2.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
<script src="~/Scripts/select2.min.js"></script>
